  "content": "\n\n<p>今天就申請一台伺服器，與朋友一起遊玩吧！點擊 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅 &amp; 使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享受 25% 折扣！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/684/717/cbf4e971-7207-4602-bd76-b44081f9b7df.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: andale mono, monospace;\"><strong>哥德 RPG 字型</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">藉由這款易於閱讀的哥德式與中世紀風格字型，您的原版遊戲體驗將獲得進一步提升。此字型專為 <a style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包製作，現已開放公眾下載！<br /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">本字型基於 Typodermic Fonts 所設計的 <a style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://fontmeme.com/fonts/vinque-font/\">Vinque</a> 字型。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\">本字型採用自由字型授權（Free Font License）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: andale mono, monospace; font-size: 18px;\"><br /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/636/vinque-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: andale mono, monospace;\"><strong>遊戲截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/558/457/2022-12-19_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/558/458/2022-12-18_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>點擊下方橫幅今天就申請伺服器！或前往 <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\">BisectHosting.com</a>&nbsp;，記得輸入優惠碼 '<strong>gamerpotion</strong>' 以享受 25% 折扣。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/608/745/bisect-banner-large3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"415\" /></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ko-fi.com/gamerpotion\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_bg_tag_dark.png\" width=\"341\" height=\"129\" /></a></p>",
